--cpp11 --unwind 5
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ conditions that are declarations of class, pointer, float and int type: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
